              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'Abamanaase tibarabingire batuuzi b'omuri Besi-sheani na tauni zaayo, nari aba Tanaki na tauni zaayo, nari aba Doori na tauni zaayo, nari aba Ibuleamu na tauni zaayo, n'obu baakuba ab'omuri Megido na tauni zaayo; kureka Abanyakanaani bakaguma beetuuriire omuri egyo nsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Abaisraeli ku baaherize kugira amaani, baakoresa Abanyakanaani emirimo y'obuhuuku; tibaababingiramu kimwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.28"
            ]
          }
        }
