        {
          "text": "N'Abazebuluuni tibarabingire batuuzi b'omuri Kitirooni, n'obu baakuba ab'omuri Nahalooli; kureka Abanyakanaani bakaguma batwire nabo, nibabakorera emirimo y'obuhuuku.",
